# PHP Quick Reference

## Naming
```php
// Prefix: skel_
function skel_function_name() { }
$variable_name = 'value';

// Text domain: 'skel'
__( 'Text', 'skel' );
esc_html_e( 'Text', 'skel' );
```

## Formatting
```php
// Spaces inside parentheses
if ( $condition ) { }
function_call( $arg1, $arg2 );

// Tabs for indentation (not spaces)
```

## Escaping (Always)
```php
echo esc_html( $text );
echo esc_attr( $attribute );
echo esc_url( $url );
echo wp_kses_post( $html_content );
```

## Sanitizing (Always)
```php
$clean = sanitize_text_field( $_POST['field'] );
$email = sanitize_email( $_POST['email'] );
$int = absint( $_GET['id'] );
```

## The Loop
```php
<?php if ( have_posts() ) : ?>
	<?php while ( have_posts() ) : the_post(); ?>
		<article <?php post_class(); ?>>
			<?php the_title( '<h2>', '</h2>' ); ?>
			<?php the_content(); ?>
		</article>
	<?php endwhile; ?>
<?php endif; ?>
```

## Template Parts
```php
get_template_part( 'template-parts/content', get_post_type() );

// With args (WP 5.5+)
get_template_part( 'template-parts/card', 'product', [
	'product_id' => $id,
] );
```
